# Stage documents (MDX) land here.
#
# Nothing is scaffolded yet, and that is deliberate: templates are GENERATED
# from project.yaml's activated artifact types plus their schemas (#43), and
# neither exists yet. Hand-writing stage documents now would be authoring the
# exact thing #43 says must be generated — and a template that disagrees with
# its schema teaches the agent the wrong shape.
#
# These appear once step 2 of next-steps.md lands the first schemas.
